{"type": "item.completed", "item": {"id": "item_18", "type": "command_execution", "command": "/bin/bash -c \"rg 'hyp-20261002-002-r2s1' cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\"", "aggregated_output": "{\"id\": \"hyp-20261002-002-r2s1\", \"title\": \"Retime division with a launch-time prefix and registered completion boundary\", \"category\": \"structural\", \"motivation\": \"The structural attempt hyp-20261002-002-r1s1 raised fitness to 91.82\\nand median Gowin Fmax to 41.241 MHz by making division iterative.\\nLESSONS.md and log.jsonl show that arithmetic sharing without registers\\nfailed, while prediction left the original divider timing bottleneck.\\nThe champion's recorded 29.998 ns worst path starts at\\ncpu/u_ex/u_alu/remainder_q_5_s0 and passes through the ALU and EX toward\\ndmem. In the current RTL, last_iteration exposes four serial restoring\\nsteps, result selection and sign correction directly to EX/MEM.\\nThis is evidence for retiming the divider's completion path; it is not\\nevidence that another instruction pipeline stage or a predictor is needed.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": {\"motivation\": \"The structural attempt hyp-20261002-002-r1s1 raised fitness to 91.82\\nand median Gowin Fmax to 41.241 MHz by making division iterative.\\nLESSONS.md and log.jsonl show that arithmetic sharing without registers\\nfailed, while prediction left the original divider timing bottleneck.\\nThe champion's recorded 29.998 ns worst path starts at\\ncpu/u_ex/u_alu/remainder_q_5_s0 and passes through the ALU and EX toward\\ndmem. In the current RTL, last_iteration exposes four serial restoring\\nsteps, result selection and sign correction directly to EX/MEM.\\nThis is evidence for retiming the divider's completion path; it is not\\nevidence that another instruction pipeline stage or a predictor is needed.\\n\", \"hypothesis\": \"Redistribute the existing division work across request capture, seven\\nfull-width iteration cycles, and a completion phase. Compute the first\\nfour quotient bits during request acceptance, where the partial dividend\\nis only the leading four bits of the normalized dividend. After the\\nremaining seven four-bit iterations, expose only registered quotient\\nand remainder state to sign correction and EX. This is one structural\\nretiming of the \n…[7473 of 10545 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:2c0abe59d6120d12]…\ness\": 102.63, \"delta_pct\": 11.77, \"vs_baseline\": 746.78, \"fmax_mhz\": 46.095, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4491485, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 2939, \"ff\": 631, \"seeds\": [43.547, 46.095, 46.095], \"perturbations\": [[0, 43.547, 24], [1, 46.095, 24], [2, 46.095, 24]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_ex/reg_q.rd_1_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/id_ex_w.rs2_val_0_s100\", \"slack_ns\": -17.963, \"arrival_ns\": 28.258, \"logic_cells\": 55, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_fwd\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 24, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T06:30:12.868722Z\", \"slot\": 1, \"round_id\": 2, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-002-r2s1 (improvement, +11.77%): A narrow four-bit launch prefix lets quotient_q/remainder_q isolate the final restoring steps from sign correction and EX/MEM selection without delaying the t8 result handshake, improving timing without extra divide stalls.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
