o ordinary EX arithmetic/result selection.\n- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-003-r5s2 (regression, +7.91%): With forwarding resolved before ID/EX and flop register-file storage, compact agree/early-JAL prediction cut CoreMark cycles 6.41% without losing Fmax (56.909 to 57.470 MHz), but the unchanged divider recurrence remained critical and left 136.72 iterations/s behind the parallel-divider variant's 152.61.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
