rrow radix-16 selectors on the first busy edge; keep the next six full-width iterations and exact existing completion protocol. Preserve all other arithmetic and ALTOPS behavior.'},\n {'file':'test/test_alu.py','description':'Retain every result, exception and handshake check. Update the independent per-iteration model for zero launch work, eight first-cycle bits and six four-bit steps. Add first-byte thresholds, high-bit guards, signed boundaries, snapshots, result holds and reset coverage.'}\n ]}\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=88))\njsonschema.validate(d,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Replaced and validated',p)\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
