e, pending the implementation gates.\n  Require all three placements and unchanged marker-delimited throughput;\n  acceptance is strictly above 218.55124 iterations/s, or 87.072453 MHz\n  at 3984075 cycles. Repeat all unchanged correctness gates, including\n  formal; passing ALTOPS does not establish real M arithmetic correctness.\n\n'''+s[b:]\ns=s.replace('  Check positive/negative AUIPC immediates, immediate dependent consumers,\\\\n  subsequent loads/stores and ordinary PC-relative control transfers.\\\\n', '')\ns=s.replace('  fitness_delta_pct: 5\\\\n  confidence: low','  fitness_delta_pct: 8\\\\n  confidence: medium')\ns=s.replace('Prepare direct rs1+imm addresses, replicated store data, byte masks and alignment flags and capture them at the existing EX/MEM boundary. Feed ALU.a from rs1 and select the existing PC-relative sum for AUIPC after the ALU, preserving divide/jump priority, all stage holds, bubbles, snapshots and control-flow behavior.', 'Prepare direct rs1+imm addresses, replicated store data, byte masks and alignment flags and capture them at the existing EX/MEM boundary. Preserve the original scalar ALU and AUIPC paths, divide/jump selection, all stage holds, bubbles, raw source snapshots and control-flow behavior.')\ns=s.replace('add prepared-request and AUIPC dependency tests', 'add prepared-request dependency tests')\np.write_text(s)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
