  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: >-\n      Preserve existing pipeline and cycle assertions. Exercise WB writes\n      seen by both ID sources, EX/MEM forwarding over older RF values,\n      read-before-first-write after reset, reset after nonzero register\n      contents, and backend holds. Check exact RVFI operands/results,\n      source priority, retirement order and memory side effects.\nYAML\npython - <<'PY'\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\np='cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-002-r14s1.yaml'\njsonschema.validate(yaml.safe_load(open(p)),json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Updated hypothesis is schema-valid')\nPY\"", "aggregated_output": "Updated hypothesis is schema-valid\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
