ion gates;\nALTOPS formal alone does not establish the new real arithmetic.\n\nAdapt internal arithmetic-state assertions to a 35-bit initial quotient,\nzero initial remainder and five-bit recurrence without removing any\nexisting operand vector or architectural assertion. Extend the existing\narbitrary-R<D recurrence test from 16 to all 32 digit possibilities,\ncheck all 31 registered multiples, boundaries kD-1/kD/kD+1, maximum\n37-bit trials, and large divisors. Retain signed/unsigned corner cases,\nzero division, input changes after launch, seven busy edges, t8 acceptance,\nlong completion backpressure, reset cancellation and all pipeline hazards.\n'\"''',\n 'expected_impact':{'fitness_delta_pct':6,'confidence':'low'},\n 'changes':[\n {'file':'rtl/alu.sv','description':'''Replace the launch prefix/radix-16 engine with a 35-bit dividend/quotient,\nzero-remainder initialization and seven radix-32 digits. Capture exact\n37-bit multiples 1..31 using carry-save constant-product preparation;\nuse full 38-bit borrow decisions and balanced one-hot digit selection.\nPreserve request/completion timing, sign/exception semantics, snapshots,\nreset, integer/MUL datapaths and the exact ALTOPS branch/controller.'''},\n {'file':'test/test_alu.py','description':'''Preserve all arithmetic vectors and external protocol checks. Update\ninternal state models for 35-bit quotient, zero-prefix launch and five-bit\ndigits. Extend multiple-bank checks to 31D and recurrence assertions to\nall 32 digits, boundary trials and 37-bit intermediates. Verify original\nsigned/unsigned results, input isolation, holds, reset and exact t8 timing.'''},\n {'file':'test/test_alu_altops.py','description':'''Retain every existing exact ALTOPS formula and timing assertion. Confirm\nthat real-engine restructuring has not changed launch, seven busy cycles,\ncompletion retention, ready/valid behavior or operand isolation.'''},\n {'file':'test/test_pipeline.py','description':'''Retain every existing forwarding