{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_57","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport yaml,json,jsonschema\np=Path('cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20261002-002-r9s1.yaml');d=yaml.safe_load(p.read_text());h=d['hypothesis']\na=h.index('Capture widened divisor multiples');b=h.index('At each of seven busy edges',a)\nh=h[:a]+'''Capture widened odd divisor multiples 1D,3D,...,31D at launch; derive\nall even multiples by constant left shifts of the corresponding stored\nodd multiple. Use 37 unsigned bits throughout: 31*UINT_MAX fits and all\nfive incoming bits participate in each borrow decision. Reuse divisor_q\nfor 1D. Generate odd constant products with exact shifts/adds/subtracts,\nusing at most three signed power-of-two terms. For example 3D=4D-D,\n11D=8D+4D-D, 13D=16D+D-4D, 19D=16D+4D-D, 21D=16D+4D+D,\n23D=32D-8D-D, 25D=32D+D-8D, 27D=32D-4D-D, 29D=32D-2D-D,\nand 31D=32D-D. Keep all intermediate terms 37 bits. Build each even\nmultiple directly from its odd root plus a static shift: 6D=3D<<1,\n12D=3D<<2 and 24D=3D<<3. These are wires after the registers, not\ncascaded launch-time adders or new independent registers. Every required\nshift fits the 37-bit result. Keep the odd storage and derived all-multiple\nwires in separate arrays to avoid Verilator's false combinational-array\nloop warning; place odd-product declarations only in the odd generate\nbranch. Preserve simultaneous request capture and frozen operands.\nDo not use carry-save constant-product logic: the measured refinement\nincreased LUTs and regressed median timing. Use portable logic with no\nruntime / or %, ROM, vendor primitive or extra normalization cycle.\n\n'''+h[b:]\nh=h.replace('Timing still includes\\\\nnormalization into complex divisor multiples; carry-save generation is\\\\nthe concrete refinement proposed here. Its timing is not yet established.', 'The proposed odd-only\\\\nregister bank is a refinement to reduce redundant storage and launch\\\\nlogic while retaining this schedule; its timing is not yet established.')\nh=h.replace('Do not claim the preliminary probe cleared the tournament threshold.', 'A separate carry-save multiple-generation probe passed the real and\\\\nALTOPS arithmetic suites but fell to 74.762 MHz; exclude that version.\\\\nDo not claim the preliminary probe cleared the tournament threshold.')\nd['hypothesis']=h\nd['changes'][0]['description']=d['changes'][0]['description'].replace('37-bit multiples 1..31 using carry-save constant-product preparation;', '37-bit odd multiples 1..31 using exact constant shifts/adds/subtracts;\\\\nderive even multiples from registered odd roots with constant shifts;')\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(d,sort_keys=False,width=88));jsonschema.validate(d,json.load(open('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json')))\nprint('Validated refined hypothesis')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
