>1\nprint('All eight transitions and all four prediction mappings agree.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"/srv/hwebench/tmp/84625fbe/c47585f8/predictor_thermometer\nAll eight transitions and all four prediction mappings agree.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
