e saving still lost to validity-only squashing at 52.313 MHz.\n- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-001-r4s0 (regression, -3.79%): Balanced masked-OR ALU/EX selection with `syn_keep` cut post-multiply LUT depth from seven to five, but routing left selection delay near 6 ns and median Fmax fell from 52.313 to 50.326 MHz with unchanged CoreMark cycles.\n- 2026-10-02 hyp-2\n…[145563 of 148635 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:cc6fa8cc0bc0c24d]…\ndiffers\\nfrom raw-fetch PC, aliasing, all legal/reserved branch functions, held\\nEX branches, wrong-path branches, misaligned targets and FENCE.I. Verify\\nexact-once training, unchanged prediction choices, RVFI order/operands,\\nno wrong-path memory effects, and unchanged CoreMark marker cycles.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 212.1, \"delta_pct\": 1.51, \"vs_baseline\": 1650.0, \"fmax_mhz\": 84.503, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3984075, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6655, \"ff\": 2811, \"seeds\": [80.232, 84.503, 84.503], \"perturbations\": [[0, 80.232, 10], [1, 84.503, 10], [2, 84.503, 10]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 2, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.pc_8_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_2_dmem_2_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -7.464, \"arrival_ns\": 17.758, \"logic_cells\": 10, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 10, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T14:18:00.380007Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 12}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
