tional B/J immediate extraction and a shared PC-relative target\\nadder. Reset counters to weakly taken (2'b10). Predict legal conditional\\nbranches from the counter MSB and legal JAL instructions unconditionally\\ntaken; predict all other instructions, including JALR, sequentially.\\nOnly predict an aligned \n…[149365 of 152437 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:a202ae65d5a48536]…\n8, \"delta_pct\": 5.62, \"vs_baseline\": 1229.87, \"fmax_mhz\": 67.751, \"ipc_coremark\": 2e-06, \"cycles\": 4203513, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 4784, \"ff\": 1934, \"seeds\": [65.508, 67.751, 67.751], \"perturbations\": [[0, 65.508, 17], [1, 67.751, 9], [2, 67.751, 9]], \"lutram\": 0, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.ctrl.is_auipc_s0\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu/remainder_q_3_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -10.265, \"arrival_ns\": 20.56, \"logic_cells\": 19, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 17, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T08:48:53.445235Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 6, \"lesson\": \"- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-003-r6s2 (improvement, +5.62%): A 16-entry agree predictor plus early JAL complements the parallel radix-16 divider by removing direct-control-flow bubbles while preserving fully forwarded ID/EX operands and validity-only recovery, raising CoreMark throughput from 152.61 to 161.18 iterations/s.\"}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
